      "stem": "You inspect an intermediate snapshot of an array being sorted by one of the three elementary sorts (`Insertion`, `Bubble`, or `Selection`). The original array was `[40, 15, 30, 10, 25, 5, 20]`, and after 2 passes the array is `[5, 10, 30, 40, 25, 15, 20]`. Which algorithm produced this snapshot?",
