          "text": "If the maximum element was at `A[left]`, the first swap `swap(A[left], A[minIdx])` moves that maximum to `A[minIdx]`, so the second swap `swap(A[right], A[maxIdx])` swaps `A[right]` with the minimum now at `A[left]`."
