      "learning_objective_id": "T08_2_LO2",
      "question_category": "tracing_application",
      "stem": "In our explicit-stack iterative Tower of Hanoi (`ACT_C08_02`), the recursive body for `n > 1` executes three steps in sequence:\nStep 1: `hanoi(n - 1, src, aux, dst)`\nStep 2: `moveSingleDisk(src -> dst)`\nStep 3: `hanoi(n - 1, aux, dst, src)`\nWhen simulating this on a LIFO stack `st`, in what order must these three tasks be pushed onto `st` when expanding `(n, src, dst, aux)`?",
