      "answer_explanation": "Pass 1 (`sz = 1`) merges `A[0..0]` with `A[1..1]` (`[38],[27] -> [27, 38]`), `A[2..2]` with `A[3..3]` (`[43],[3] -> [3, 43]`), and `A[4..4]` with `A[5..5]` (`[9],[82] -> [9, 82]`). Element `A[6] = 10` has no partner in Pass 1 and stays `[10]` until merged in Pass 2 (`sz = 2`).",
