      "learning_objective_id": "T09_1_LO2",
      "question_category": "tracing_application",
      "stem": "In our Merge Sort inversion-counting algorithm (`ACT_C09_01`), when merging two sorted halves `L[0 .. mid]` and `R[mid+1 .. r]`, suppose `L[i] > R[j]` at the current step. How many new inversions involving `R[j]` are discovered and added to `invCount` at the moment `R[j]` is placed into the merged array?",
      "options": [
        {
          "option_id": "A",
          "text": "`j - (mid + 1)` inversions, counting the number of elements in the right half `R` that have already been copied before `R[j]`."
        },
        {
          "option_id": "B",
          "text": "Only `1` inversion (for the single pair `(L[i], R[j])`), because the remaining elements `L[i+1 .. mid]` are not compared with `R[j]` yet."
        },
        {
          "option_id": "C",
          "text": "`mid - i + 1` inversions since `L` is sorted, so `L[i] > R[j]` implies `L[i], L[i+1],..., L[mid]` are all strictly greater than `R[j]`."
        },
        {
          "option_id": "D",
          "text": "`r - j + 1` inversions."
        }
      ],
      "correct_option_id": "C",
      "answer_explanation": "Because `L[i .. mid]` is already sorted in non-decreasing order (`L[i] <= L[i+1] <= ... <= L[mid]`), if `L[i] > R[j]`, then every single one of the `mid - i + 1` elements remaining in `L` is also strictly greater than `R[j]` and appeared before `R[j]`. Counting all `mid - i + 1` inversions in `O(1)` time allows Merge Sort to count all inversions of an array in `Theta(n log n)` time (compared to `Theta(n^2)` brute force).",
      "distractor_explanations": {
        "A": "Counts already-merged elements in `R` instead of remaining elements in `L`.",
        "B": "Adding only `1` misses the inversions between `L[i+1 .. mid]` and `R[j]`, since `R[j]` is immediately consumed (`++j`) and never compared against `L[i+1 .. mid]` again.",
        "D": "Counts remaining elements in `R` instead of `L` (`L[i] > R[j]` does not imply `L[i] > R[j+1]`)."
      },
      "difficulty_estimate": "hard",
      "misconception_tags": [
        "merge_sort_inversion_count_formula"
      ],
      "authorship_type": "AI-assisted team-authored",
