      "stem": "Suppose Quick Sort's partition step always produces a 9-to-1 proportional split (`9n/10` on one side and `n/10` on the other: `T(n) = T(9n/10) + T(n/10) + c * n`). What is the asymptotic solution to `T(n)`?",
