      "stem": "Starting from the valid 0-indexed Max-Heap `A = [10, 5, 3, 4, 1]` (`n = 5`), trace the first extraction step (`end = 4`: `std::swap(A[0], A[4]); siftDown(A, 4, 0);`) of Heap Sort. What is the resulting array `A`?",
