      "question_category": "edge_cases_complexity",
      "stem": "What happens if all `n` elements of the input array `A` are identical (`A = [7, 7, 7, ..., 7]`) and we run Heap Sort (where `siftDown` stops immediately when `A[i] >= max(A[left], A[right])`)?",
