      "stem": "By the Full Binary Tree Theorem, in any non-empty binary tree, if `n_0` is the number of leaf nodes (degree 0) and `n_2` is the number of internal nodes with two children (degree 2), what exact relationship always holds between `n_0` and `n_2`?",
