      "question_category": "tracing_application",
      "stem": "A binary tree with distinct node labels has:\n- Preorder traversal: `F, B, A, D, C, E, G, I, H`\n- Inorder traversal: `A, B, C, D, E, F, G, H, I`\nWhat is the root of the entire tree, which nodes belong to its right subtree, and what is the Postorder traversal of the entire tree?",
