      "question_category": "tracing_application",
      "stem": "An Expression Tree has root `*`, whose left child is `+` (with children `3` and `4`) and whose right child is `-` (with left child `10` and right child `2`). What do the Preorder, Postorder, and parenthesized Inorder traversals of this expression tree produce?",
