      "question_category": "tracing_application",
      "stem": "In a 2-3-4 Tree using proactive top-down splitting, suppose the root is a 2-node `[30]`, its left child is a 2-node `[10]`, and its right child is a 4-node `[40, 50, 60]`. Trace what happens as we insert key `55` using top-down insertion.",
