      "learning_objective_id": "T10_5_LO2",
      "question_category": "tracing_application",
      "stem": "If a B-Tree of minimum degree `t = 4` (`max 7 keys`) has height `h = 2` (in edges, i.e., 3 levels: root, level 1, and level 2 leaves) and every node in the tree is completely full (`7` keys and `8` children per internal node), how many total keys are stored in the tree?",
