      "stem": "A campus navigation system models `V = 20,000` road intersections where each intersection connects to at most 4 neighboring intersections (`E <= 40,000`). If a student attempts to allocate a `V x V` Adjacency Matrix of 4-byte `int`s (`int mat[20000][20000]`), approximately how much memory does the matrix require compared to an Adjacency List?",
