      "learning_objective_id": "T12_1_LO3",
      "question_category": "code_trace",
      "stem": "Suppose you are given a 2D grid of `R x C` cells containing walls `'#'`, empty cells `'.'`, and `k >= 2` fire source cells `'F'` that all start spreading simultaneously at time `t = 0` (1 step per second to 4-directional neighbors). How do you compute for every cell `(r, c)` the minimum time `dist[r][c]` until fire reaches it, in `O(R * C)` total time?",
      "options": [
        {
          "option_id": "A",
          "text": "Run one Multi-Source BFS: set `dist[f_r][f_c] = 0` and push all `k` fire cells `'F'` into `Q` at level 0 before starting `while (!Q.empty())`."
        },
        {
          "option_id": "B",
          "text": "Run `k` separate full BFS traversals (one from each fire cell `'F'`) and take the minimum distance per cell in `O(k * R * C)` total execution time."
        },
        {
          "option_id": "C",
          "text": "Push only the first fire source `'F'` into `Q`, and push the remaining `'F'` sources when the queue becomes empty."
        },
        {
          "option_id": "D",
          "text": "Use Depth-First Search (DFS) starting from all `'F'` cells."
        }
      ],
      "correct_option_id": "A",
      "answer_explanation": "Pushing all `k` sources `{s_1, ..., s_k}` into `Q` with `dist[s_i] = 0` before the BFS loop begins is conceptually identical to adding a virtual super-source `S^*` with weight-0 edges to every `s_i`. The FIFO wavefront expands simultaneously from all `k` sources in a single `O(V + E) = O(R * C)` pass.",
      "distractor_explanations": {
        "B": "Running `k` separate BFS calls takes `O(k * R * C)` time (which TLEs when `k = O(R * C)`), whereas a single Multi-Source BFS computes the exact same minimum distances in `O(R * C)` time.",
        "C": "Waiting until the first source's BFS finishes before pushing the second source destroys the simultaneous wavefront invariant.",
        "D": "DFS does not compute shortest distances on grids."
      },
      "difficulty_estimate": "hard",
      "misconception_tags": [
        "MC_MULTI_SOURCE_BFS_INITIALIZATION"
      ],
      "authorship_type": "AI-assisted team-authored",
      "reference_sources": [
        "https://opendsa-server.cs.vt.edu/ODSA/Books/Catalog/html/index.html",
        "https://cp-algorithms.com/graph/breadth-first-search.html"
      ],
      "verification_method": "compile_and_run",
      "agent_check_status": "passed",
      "human_review_status": "pending",
      "approved_by": null,
      "approved_at": null,
