      "stem": "Consider the DAG with `V = 6` vertices `{0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5}` and directed edges:\n`0 -> 2`, `0 -> 3`, `1 -> 3`, `1 -> 4`, `2 -> 5`, `3 -> 5`, `4 -> 5`.\nWhich of the following statements about the topological orderings of this DAG is true?",
