          "option_id": "A",
          "text": "1 -> Dijkstra (`O((V+E) log V)`); 2 -> Bellman-Ford (`O(VE)`); 3 -> BFS (`O(V+E)`); 4 -> Dijkstra (`O((V+E) log V)`)."
