      "correct_option_id": "B",
      "answer_explanation": "Matching graph structural invariants to the appropriate single-source shortest-path algorithm:\n1. Unit weights -> FIFO Queue BFS in `O(V + E)`\n2. Directed Acyclic Graph (DAG) with arbitrary weights -> Topological Sort + 1-pass DP in `O(V + E)`\n3. Non-negative weights -> Dijkstra with Min-Heap in `O((V + E) log V)`\n4. General weights / negative edges -> Bellman-Ford in `O(V * E)`",
